# service, site "our Ghent plant", own_ops what the company runs itself, unit measured unit, pack / Pack packaging
# phrase, mat material, supp suppliers, fleet vehicles, scope what a certificate covers, raw main raw material,
# workers the people the claim is about, generic = one concrete fact for a broad claim.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
