# of Annex I are those of the UCPD blacklist as amended by EmpCo (2a label, 4a generic claim, 4b whole-product or
# whole-business claim, 4c offsetting claim, 10a legal requirement presented as a feature).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
